        "cooked": "<p>Spread the word. I’ll be running Sentinels of the Multiverse games at InConJunction Sat/Sun Jul 7/8 from 10am to 2pm.</p>\n<p>This is a local Indianapolis scifi &amp; fantasy convention that has grown into having a good-sized gaming section in recent years and is adding a dealer hall this year. They’re expecting about 800 people.</p>\n<p>If you’re going to be there, please drop by and say hi. Be forewarned, if I think you know what you are doing and I’m mobbed, I will press gang you into running more games. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.inconjunction.org/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.inconjunction.org/</a></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
