        "raw": "Spread the word. I'll be running Sentinels of the Multiverse games at InConJunction Sat/Sun Jul 7/8 from 10am to 2pm.\n\nThis is a local Indianapolis scifi & fantasy convention that has grown into having a good-sized gaming section in recent years and is adding a dealer hall this year. They're expecting about 800 people.\n\nIf you're going to be there, please drop by and say hi. Be forewarned, if I think you know what you are doing and I'm mobbed, I will press gang you into running more games. :)\n\nhttp://www.inconjunction.org/",
