        "created_at": "2012-07-09T01:26:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was the person who played some of the playtest decks with you.  That Plague Rat was the second-worst beating I’ve taken in any game of Sentinels to date.  But at least we smashed Voss pretty easily.  Hope the rest of the convention went well for you!</p>",
