        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-09T02:18:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All done!</p>\n<p>The second day of games was tons of fun. Started slow – no takers at first, but then busy for four hours straight. Not a lot of people, but the people who played stuck around for multiple games. Finished the day with back-to-back losses against The Chairman on Mars. After a prison break sent Bunker, Tempest, and Fanatic reeling, we decided to try again and came SO CLOSE, but couldn’t quite pull it out. Decked The Chairman. Decked Mars. The Chairman and The Operative were in the low teens when our heroes succumbed.</p>\n<p>Hello Eykir! Welcome to the forums!</p>\n<p>My hope is that many of the very cool people I met this weekend will not only be inspired to join us here on the forums, but also come out to our regular meetups at Comic Carnival and Arsenal.</p>",
